{"id":"en_the-wolfless-alpha-queen","title":"The Wolfless Alpha Queen","titleEn":"The Wolfless Alpha Queen","description":"Thirteen years back, a betrayal shattered the Bloodwolf Clan. Its rightful princess, then only a child, was abandoned in the wilderness and forgot everything about her origins. Now nineteen, she suddenly awakens the immense Progenitor's Power. When she comes back, she discovers her mother has been tortured and her father left paralyzed, while the traitors work hand in hand with an enemy to bring the clan down from within. Can the true-born princess take back her throne and rescue her people?","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-wolfless-alpha-queen/en_US/4fe59afea2519298/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-wolfless-alpha-queen/en_US/4fe59afea2519298/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Strong Heroine","Werewolf","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dld54/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_the-wolfless-alpha-queen_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dld54/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-wolfless-alpha-queen_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dld54/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-wolfless-alpha-queen_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dld54/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-wolfless-alpha-queen_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dld54/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},